  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Transpositions (2018), published by Leuven University Press, has been cited 3 times. Beyond that, it is used in teaching.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Transpositions by Michael Schwab was published by Leuven University Press in 2018. Conceptually, the work connects to Computer science.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">OpenAlex records 3 citations. Citations peaked in 2020 with 1 citing works. Notable citing venues include Communiquer Revue de communication sociale et publique, Trio and Communication. They come from 2 countries, led by Canada and Finland.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">In teaching, it is discussed in 1 recorded lecture. It is recorded in 1 library collection. The work was funded by European Research Council.</p>",
